{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/pulls/1865","id":3586297293,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO9n4nc7Vwo3N","html_url":"https://github.com/THUDM/slime/pull/1865","diff_url":"https://github.com/THUDM/slime/pull/1865.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/THUDM/slime/pull/1865.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/issues/1865","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/pulls/1865/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/pulls/1865/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/issues/1865/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/THUDM/slime/statuses/899044cd2e63e1347f4bdde6f85a5e5d5829d120","number":1865,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Megatron-Bridge LoRA support for GRPO actor training","user":{"login":"taivu1998","id":46636857,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjM2ODU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46636857?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998","html_url":"https://github.com/taivu1998","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAddresses #1202.\n\nThis PR adds a first supported Megatron-Bridge LoRA path for dense GRPO actor training in slime. It introduces LoRA CLI flags, validates the initially supported configuration at startup, applies Megatron-Bridge PEFT LoRA only to the actor model, and exports effective actor weights to SGLang by temporarily merging adapters into the live model during bridge-based HF weight conversion.\n\n## Why\n\nIssue #1202 asks for LoRA support for GRPO training and examples. The discussion also calls out known Megatron-Bridge LoRA risk around MoE and checkpointing paths, so this implementation intentionally starts with a narrow, guarded dense-model path rather than silently enabling unsupported combinations.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added `--enable-lora`, `--lora-target-modules`, `--lora-rank`, `--lora-alpha`, and `--lora-dropout`.\n- Added validation for the first supported LoRA slice:\n  - Megatron backend.\n  - Megatron-Bridge HF export mode.\n  - GRPO actor training.\n  - Colocated rollout outside debug train-only runs.\n  - Dense models only.\n  - Default weight backuper enabled.\n- Added a Megatron LoRA helper module that:\n  - lazily imports Megatron-Bridge PEFT LoRA.\n  - builds the LoRA config from slime args.\n  - applies LoRA only to the actor provider path.\n  - logs local trainable and total parameter counts.\n  - restores TensorBackuper-style model weights around temporary LoRA merge export.\n- Updated bridge weight export so LoRA runs export `base + adapter` effective actor weights to SGLang, then restore unmerged training weights.\n- Added focused unit tests for validation, config mapping, actor-only application, merge traversal, and backup restore safety.\n- Added an English advanced usage page with a concrete GRPO LoRA flag example and linked it from the docs index.\n\n## Guardrails\n\nThe PR rejects combinations that need separate parity work before support:\n\n- MoE models.\n- PPO or critic-based training.\n- Decoupled rollout mode outside `--debug-train-only`.\n- Custom model providers.\n- `--only-train-params-name-list` and `--freeze-params-name-list`.\n- On-policy distillation.\n- Reference model update intervals.\n- `--disable-weights-backuper`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `env UV_CACHE_DIR=/tmp/uv-cache PYTHONPATH=. uv run pytest tests/test_lora_support.py` -> `22 passed`\n- `python3 -m py_compile slime/backends/megatron_utils/peft.py slime/backends/megatron_utils/model_provider.py slime/backends/megatron_utils/model.py slime/backends/megatron_utils/update_weight/hf_weight_iterator_bridge.py slime/utils/arguments.py tests/test_lora_support.py`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n`uv run ruff check ...` was attempted locally but could not run because this worktree environment does not have a `ruff` executable installed.\n\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-26T19:23:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:17:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"taivu1998:tdv/issue-1202-lora-grpo","ref":"tdv/issue-1202-lora-grpo","repo":{"id":1221863548,"node_id":"R_kgDOSNQofA","name":"slime","full_name":"taivu1998/slime","owner":{"login":"taivu1998","id":46636857,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjM2ODU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46636857?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998","html_url":"https://github.com/taivu1998","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taivu1998/received_events","type":"Use